+# Version numbering scheme
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to use semantic versioning (semver, MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH) for release versioning, because API compatibility matters more to users and downstream consumers than publication dates, and the MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH scheme directly signals breaking API changes.
